  "title": "Chinook | Pipeline Health & Operations — پایش سلامت پایپ‌لاین",
  "description": "Operational monitoring from PostgreSQL staging.event_processing. Selected-period panels use started_at_utc; panels marked Live inspect current ledger states across all history. Processing duration = completed_at_utc - started_at_utc for APPLIED events, not Kafka lag or end-to-end CDC latency. The >5m stuck threshold is provisional for this lab. Only 3 test events have been observed so far; these results are not a production SLA. | پایش وضعیت جاری و روند پردازش از دفتر ثبت رویدادهای PostgreSQL.",
